          "text": "Description: On October 18 in the late afternoon, a witness observed several dozen white glowing points very high in the sky. They moved very slowly from East to West. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon, for which we lack information, even though it suggests a \"characteristic\" observation of Thai lanterns.",
